// Title: Microsoft Office DLL Sideload
// Rule ID: 829a3bdf-34da-4051-9cf4-8ed221a8ae4f
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_side_load_office_dlls.yml
